Bone shields start circling around you. They will each fully absorb one instance of damage.

[1, 1, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] shield(s) will be generated when first activated.

Then every [19, 11, 8, 6, 5 (TL1-5)] turns a new one will be created if not full.

This will only trigger on hits over [7, 17, 35, 52, 70 (SP 10-100)] damage based on Spellpower.
